            <profile id="7f5b-d493-63fe-97ec" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour, and shield. May have polearm (counts as halberd, +2 pts), and plate and mail armour (counts as partial plate, +2 pts). May be taken in mixed order with Kesici Silahkarda Musellah (bow armed models only), which may no longer use Ditch &amp; Stakes. Kapikulu. Drilled rules 2, 3, and 4. Mixed Order. (Vlad the Impaler p.41)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="d20b-57cd-1a6c-ea76" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">4+</characteristic>
