              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Three crewmen armed with hand weapon. May take two additional crewmen (+10 pts each). Crew may have light armour (+2 pts), and guns may have mantlets (+10 pts per gun). Artillery. Culverins are medium artillery which confer D4 wounds. Ottoman Artillery. Mantlets. May only be taken after 1453. (Vlad the Impaler p.41)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
