              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Three crewmen armed with hand weapon. May take two additional crewmen (+10 pts each). Crew may have light armour (+2 pts), and guns may have mantlets (+10 pts per gun). Stone Thrower, but use Artillery Misfire table. Ottoman Artillery. May only be taken after 1453. (Vlad the Impaler p.41)</characteristic>
