              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Al Manjanik (Mangonel) - 75 points, with three crewmen. Despite the emergence of gunpowder artillery, the Ottomans continued to employ wooden mangonels as late as the 1480s. Gazi State: 0-1 per each 1,000 pts. Ottoman Empire: counts towards the 0-1 Al Manjanik or artillery piece per every 750 pts. (Vlad the Impaler p.42)</characteristic>
