              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, and horse. May have thrusting spear (+2 pts), shield (+2 pts); light armour (+2 pts). Skirmishers. Open Order if wearing light armour. Nomad Cavalry. 0-2 units. Ottoman Empire only. (Vlad the Impaler p.43)</characteristic>
