              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, bow, thrusting spear, light armour, shield and horse. Open Order. Expert Horsemen. Feigned Flight. 0-1 unit, only after 1386 (Ottoman Empire). (Vlad the Impaler p.43)</characteristic>
